[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_0_0_TIDE_OF_IRON]
Tide of Iron

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_0_0_TIDE_OF_IRON_DESC]
The times have changed, and the face of war will be different from the past. It makes no sense to let our soldiers rush to the front line as bullet bait, as the era of mechanization and automation has arrived.

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_0_0_TIDE_OF_IRON_desc]


[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_0_0_TIDE_OF_IRON]
钢铁洪流

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_0_0_TIDE_OF_IRON_DESC]
时代变了，战争的样貌也必将不同于往日。没有意义让我们的士兵冲在前线充当炮灰，机械与自动化的时代已经到来。

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_0_0_TIDE_OF_IRON_desc]
